OL,3,GNEWSACocaine found in milk bottle of
OL,4,Atoddler who died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple has been jailed after the
OL,7,Fdeath of a two-year-old girl who had a
OL,8,F"fatal quantity" of cocaine in her milk
OL,9,Fbottle.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,12,Faddress in Billingham in April 2024,
OL,13,Fafter reports that two-year-old Laylah
OL,14,FHatch had stopped breathing.
OL,16,FHer mother Jodie Hatch, 22, and her
OL,17,Fpartner Dale Mathie, 30, initially
OL,18,Fdenied two offences of child cruelty in
OL,19,Frelation to Laylah and a second child.
OL,20,FThey changed their pleas to guilty
OL,21,Fduring a trial at Teesside Crown Court
OL,22,Fand were sentenced on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
